end": 55.0, "text": " \u00bfHa tenido mucho estr\u00e9s o alg\u00fan golpe en la cabeza?", "tokens": [51564, 3841, 23745, 33104, 9824, 871, 18981, 277, 26300, 42032, 465, 635, 34615, 30, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0631536167754224, "compression_ratio": 1.596026490066225, "no_speech_prob": 0.543189287185669}, {"id": 24, "seek": 2800, "start": 55.0, "end": 57.0, "text": " Estr\u00e9s s\u00ed, mucho trabajo.", "tokens": [51714, 4410, 18981, 8600, 11, 9824, 18099, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0631536167754224, "compression_ratio": 1.596026490066225, "no_speech_prob": 0.543189287185669}, {"id": 25, "seek": 5700, "start": 57.0, "end": 61.0, "text": " \u00bfHa ido al dentista o le han operado de algo recientemente?", "tokens": [50364, 3841, 23745, 47771, 419, 7059, 5236, 277, 476, 7276, 2208, 1573, 368, 8655, 4214, 317, 16288, 30, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 26, "seek": 5700, "start": 61.0, "end": 62.0, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50564, 883, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 27, "seek": 5700, "start": 62.0, "end": 64.0, "text": " Vamos a explorar la cara.", "tokens": [50614, 10894, 257, 24765, 289, 635, 10962, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 28, "seek": 5700, "start": 64.0, "end": 67.0, "text": " D\u00edgame, \u00bfcu\u00e1l es el lado afectado, derecho o izquierdo?", "tokens": [50714, 413, 870, 15038, 11, 3841, 12032, 11447, 785, 806, 11631, 30626, 1573, 11, 39055, 277, 46428, 2595, 30, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 29, "seek": 5700, "start": 67.0, "end": 68.0, "text": " El derecho.", "tokens": [50864, 2699, 39055, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 30, "seek": 5700, "start": 68.0, "end": 70.0, "text": " Por favor, intent\u00e9 cerrar los ojos fuerte.", "tokens": [50914, 5269, 2294, 11, 8446, 526, 10146, 5352, 1750, 39519, 37129, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 31, "seek": 5700, "start": 70.0, "end": 72.0, "text": " Lo intent\u00e9, el derecho no cierro.", "tokens": [51014, 6130, 8446, 526, 11, 806, 39055, 572, 39769, 340, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 32, "seek": 5700, "start": 72.0, "end": 75.0, "text": " Ahora intent\u00e9 sonre\u00edr ense\u00f1ando los dientes.", "tokens": [51114, 18840, 8446, 526, 1872, 265, 31338, 31275, 1806, 1750, 1026, 9240, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 33, "seek": 5700, "start": 75.0, "end": 77.0, "text": " No se mueve el audio derecho.", "tokens": [51264, 883, 369, 49532, 303, 806, 6278, 39055, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 34, "seek": 5700, "start": 77.0, "end": 80.0, "text": " \u00bfRota que se escapa la saliva o le cuesta pronunciar?", "tokens": [51364, 3841, 49, 5377, 631, 369, 12663, 4306, 635, 43540, 277, 476, 2702, 7841, 7569, 11228, 289, 30, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1028660976525509, "compression_ratio": 1.5357142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 0.022603532299399376}, {"id": 35, "seek": 5700, "start": 80.0, "end": 83.0, "text": " S\u00ed